{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Change a plan"},"description":"Change a plan with a list of ops, applied in order, all or nothing. Days are named by date (YYYY-MM-DD). Ops: {\"op\":\"set_title\",\"title\"}; {\"op\":\"set_start_date\",\"startDate\"} (moves every day and booking); {\"op\":\"add_day\",\"date\"}; {\"op\":\"remove_day\",\"date\"}; {\"op\":\"set_day\",\"date\",\"town\"?,\"summary\"?}; {\"op\":\"add_stop\",\"date\",\"stop\":{\"title\",\"type\"?:\"activity\"|\"restaurant\"|\"freeform\",\"time\"?:\"HH:mm\",\"category\"?,\"town\"?,\"note\"?,\"prose\"?,\"minutes\"?,\"ticketsURL\"?},\"position\"?}; {\"op\":\"update_stop\",\"id\",\"fields\":{...as add_stop, null clears}}; {\"op\":\"move_stop\",\"id\",\"date\",\"position\"?}; {\"op\":\"remove_stop\",\"id\"}; {\"op\":\"update_booking\",\"id\",\"fields\":{\"booked\"?:true|false,...}}; {\"op\":\"add_booking\",\"booking\":{\"type\":\"hotel\"|\"flight\"|\"train\"|\"carRental\"|\"restaurant\"|\"activity\"|\"other\",\"title\",\"startDate\"?,\"endDate\"?,\"city\"?,\"booked\"?}}; {\"op\":\"remove_booking\",\"id\"}. Send base_seq (the seq from get_plan) so a plan changed elsewhere since you read it is refused rather than overwritten; on a conflict, read it again and redo the edit. Stop and booking ids come from get_plan. Prefer places from get_destination or get_place, by their names, so the map can place them. Ask the traveller before removing anything. Needs sign-in.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"base_seq":{"description":"The seq from get_plan or list_my_plans.","type":"integer"},"ops":{"items":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"op":{"const":"set_title"},"title":{"maxLength":200,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["op","title"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"op":{"const":"set_start_date"},"startDate":{"pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","type":"string"}},"required":["op","startDate"